name: Purpose Statement
description: >
  One participant-visible purpose statement. It may describe an authorized
  representative role, an intended request pattern and response operation, or
  a simple non-provider role such as observing. Purpose does not grant
  authority.

onBehalfOf:
  type: Coordination/Authority
  description: >
    Optional authority explaining whom the participant represents. A
    mandate-backed purpose uses Mandate/Mandate Authority, which includes
    the represented actor and mandate.

event:
  description: Optional request event type or pattern the participant intends to handle.

respondsWith:
  type: List
  itemType: Coordination/Operation
  description: Optional operation selectors the participant may use in response.

summary:
  type: Text
  description: Optional human-readable explanation of the participant's purpose.
